# Proposed retained launch/read boundary; no task, channel or runtime is qualified.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Start: "Start here · Commissioned checker\nExport-only request · independent launch domain" {class: start}
Ready: "Independent boundary ready before startup\nC1–C8 + initial fd / port / VM provenance\nU1–U6 remain unavailable"
Task: "Same retained packaging chain\nWhole standalone Taskfile → fixed script → package CLI\nExact argv / cwd / images; no build or resolution"
Channel: "Mandatory fresh fd-3 channel\nNonce / process / export / accepted closure / domain\nMissing channel refuses; no LIVE fallback"
Scratch: "SCRATCH operation mapping\nFixed logical intents → held scratch objects / emitter\nActual scratch calls ≠ unexercised native calls"
Live: "LIVE refuses scratch inputs\nActual build / UID / authority / export validation\nNo release while a required segment is unavailable"
Closure: "Complete independent read closure\nTask / global config / Python stdlib + packages / images\nRuntime loading grants no source or proxy operation"
Final: "K281 decisions → k282 repair + whole review before k269\nCredit / LIVE activation / registration / input partition unresolved\nThen qualification / audit / distinct close; no proof / pass"
Start -> Ready: "1 · earlier accepted trust base"
Ready -> Task: "2 · observe or prevent startup effects"
Task -> Channel: "3 · same parser / preflight entry"
Channel -> Scratch: "4a · fixed SCRATCH launch binding"
Channel -> Live: "4b · fixed LIVE launch binding"
Scratch -> Closure: "5a · per-operation executed / mapped / unexercised"
Live -> Closure: "5b · actual live inputs never fixtures"
Closure -> Final: "6 · whole bytes + actual backing / proxy association"
